cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Quantum Local Packing: K5 Minus Edge in R^3"
authors:
  - family-names: Santos
    given-names: Euzebio
    alias: ebiossanto
year: 2026
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ebiossanto/IA-Research-Quantum-Local-Packing"
abstract: >-
  Exact solution for the quantum local packing problem on K5 minus
  edge in R^3. Proves c_opt(q) = c_*(q) where c_* is the physical
  root of P(c,q) = 9c^3 - (q+2)c^2 - (2q+3)c - q = 0, using
  algebraic identities, resultant method, and Gram matrix rank analysis.
keywords:
  - quantum packing
  - local packing problem
  - Gram matrix
  - SDP relaxation
  - resultant
  - Lovász theta
  - K5 graph
